(text "J2 regulated 9-30 V DC -> fuse -> reverse diode -> buck.\nLMR51420XF: 500 kHz forced PWM; 5.08889 V nominal.\nR05P09D/P provides isolated raw positive/negative rails." (at 25.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02ec492e-b86c-53b3-bcc6-98b8b6f7131f"))
(sheet (at 20.32 116.84) (size 177.8 25.4) (fields_autoplaced yes) (stroke (width .254) (type default)) (fill (color 0 0 0 0)) (uuid "1b07a87a-4687-5a92-8131-80def5b6af6b") (property "Sheetname" "Filtered local +/-5 V detector rails" (at 20.32 115.57000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "collector12_power_rails.kicad_sch" (at 20.32 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "collector12" (path "/8edae43e-1310-53a9-b603-cfe88c39615b" (page "4")))))
(text "Raw +/-9 V -> preload and RC filters -> TPS7A regulators.\nQuiet +5VA and -5VA reference FCOM; local 3.3 V for ADC.\n55 mA per raw rail; verify ripple, headroom and temperature." (at 25.4 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b8e6019-077a-5964-b254-a58e2bc975fc"))
(sheet (at 20.32 152.4) (size 177.8 25.4) (fields_autoplaced yes) (stroke (width .254) (type default)) (fill (color 0 0 0 0)) (uuid "2eb3b959-9b23-5b96-b765-bb27bf04a6b7") (property "Sheetname" "Onboard regulated collector bias / controls and discharge" (at 20.32 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "collector12_bias.kicad_sch" (at 20.32 179.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "collector12" (path "/8edae43e-1310-53a9-b603-cfe88c39615b" (page "5")))))
(text "TPS2553 latch-off switch supplies CA02P-5; U23 senses output.\nSupply-ready AND host release enable the filtered manual setpoint.\n0-2.048 V program: nominal 0-200 V raw bias; default clamped zero." (at 25.4 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "73e7c8e5-fd49-54b1-aa72-30ec829be919"))
(sheet (at 20.32 187.96) (size 177.8 25.4) (fields_autoplaced yes) (stroke (width .254) (type default)) (fill (color 0 0 0 0)) (uuid "cfccebaf-b59b-5af6-ab8b-435cf7b94527") (property "Sheetname" "Floating ATmega acquisition / bidirectional optical UART" (at 20.32 186.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "collector12_readout.kicad_sch" (at 20.32 214.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "collector12" (path "/8edae43e-1310-53a9-b603-cfe88c39615b" (page "6")))))
(text "ATmega328P at 3.3 V / 8 MHz acquires ADS1115 samples.\nTwo wide DIP optical channels carry 38400 baud UART.\nHOST_VIO is a 3.3 V input; isolated ICSP requires discharged bias." (at 25.4 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2d53ba88-78c9-5dec-bcb6-83132ca3fe2f"))
(sheet (at 20.32 223.52) (size 177.8 25.4) (fields_autoplaced yes) (stroke (width .254) (type default)) (fill (color 0 0 0 0)) (uuid "ad6b9450-2210-57f6-b197-3a191e48daab") (property "Sheetname" "Collector-bias filtering / bleeders / guarded current return" (at 20.32 222.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "collector12_bias_filter.kicad_sch" (at 20.32 250.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "collector12" (path "/8edae43e-1310-53a9-b603-cfe88c39615b" (page "7")))))
(text "Two 10 kohm / 1 W filters feed FCOM through rated capacitors.\nRaw and final bleeders remain independent of host software.\nCollector connects only to SUM; rated discharge check is required." (at 25.4 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "659ea4e9-ed32-5c42-b945-abf8beb1b53f"))
(text "POWER AND REFERENCE" (at 220 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "82d87028-72a9-58ad-8d17-7fc18cc33131"))
(text "Input: regulated 9-30 V DC, nominal 12 or 24 V.\nBuck: 5.08889 V nominal; divider resistors 0.1%.\nAnalog: +5VA / -5VA and local 3.3 V.\nFCOM floats with the collector bias; PGND is chamber ground.\nESP32 is powered separately. No gun or filament connection." (at 220 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e1068d88-c3e6-5628-a796-2f8a10c6367d"))
(text "SIGNAL AND CONNECTORS" (at 220 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "840f4086-f234-5e2e-9688-1802c9596b3c"))
(text "J1: 1 SUM, 2 FCOM inner guard. J4: chamber / outer shield.\nJ2: 1 VIN, 2 PGND. J3: 1 GND, 2 HOST_VIO input,\n3 host TX, 4 host RX, 5 ENABLE, 6 RELEASE, 7 FAULTn, 8 GND.\nJ5: standard 2x3 AVR ICSP; physically disconnect bias first." (at 220 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ae1331b7-1725-5376-98c8-00f3aadd3b7c"))
(text "MECHANICAL AND VALIDATION" (at 220 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d3b724ee-bade-5e39-b172-81dd53e17ad2"))
(text "220 x 140 mm, two copper layers, four 3.2 mm NPTH holes.\nUse insulating nylon / PEEK fasteners and standoffs.\nNative ERC/DRC and pin-map audits accompany the package.\nThese checks do not establish measured analog performance." (at 220 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "983847b9-030b-5725-a274-0421223f3114"))
(text "UNBUILT ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE" (at 220 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "921294e4-47df-5781-8c19-02123e3573d3"))
(text "Validate leakage, noise, stability, settling and calibration.\nInspect construction and clean the high-impedance input.\nNo measured sensitivity or microscope resolution is claimed.\nBasic 250 VAC RMS working converter isolation.\n5 mm copper corridor; not a certified safety barrier.\nVerify raw HV and FCOM discharged before handling." (at 220 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eb0a0b29-e4f3-59aa-a3d1-ba3644c26403"))
